      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The problem is people don't optimize their avatars and avatar creators don't optimize their bases. 70k is perfectly reasonable, and most bases aim for 30-40k polys to give users room to add clothes and accessories before hitting the 70k limit. \n\nI'd also argue that if this system were to be implemented, it should be far stricter.\n\nGood: 70k polys\n\nMedium: 100k polys\n\nPoor: 150k polys\n\nVery Poor: 200k polys",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
